This is the final_mode-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the final_mode blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'final_mode', which is imported as:

    import final_mode

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(final_mode)
